  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu COVID-19 Outbreak Response 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s support to Vanuatu&apos;s COVID-19 Outbreak Response 2022 contributing to the outcomes of Vanuatu&apos;s COVID-19 Preparedness and Response Plan and its National Deployment and Vaccination Plan for COVID-19 Vaccines. Support is also in line with Australia&apos;s Vanuatu COVID-19 Development Response Plan and Annex (2020 and 2021). Key areas of support include vaccine roll out support, procurement of emergency medical equipment and COVID-19 testing resources, provision of surge support and rapid assessment, public messaging and direct support to affected area.</narrative>
  </description>
